    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Current customer ticket:\nSubject: {{ $('Webhook').first().json.body.subject }}\nBody: {{ $('Webhook').first().json.body.body }}\n\nLast 5 ticket subjects before this one (newest first):\n{{ $('Recent Subjects').first().json.recent_subjects.length ? $('Recent Subjects').first().json.recent_subjects.join(' | ') : 'None' }}\n\nSteps:\n1. Read the current customer ticket above.\n2. Use the recent subjects only as context (for example, repeated issues).\n3. Draft a professional, friendly and helpful reply to the current ticket.\n\nYour final answer has exactly two fields: \"draft\" (the reply text) and \"confidence\" (a number between 0 and 1 for how well the draft answers the ticket).",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are SmileCare Dental Clinic's AI customer support assistant.\n\nRules:\n1. Understand the customer's dental complaint.\n2. Reply politely and with empathy.\n3. Never diagnose or prescribe medicines.\n4. Recommend a professional evaluation at the clinic when needed.\n5. For difficulty breathing, heavy bleeding, severe swelling or other emergency symptoms, advise immediate emergency care.\n6. Your final answer contains only \"draft\" and \"confidence\"."
        }
      },
